    "body_normalized": "## Description\n\nFont awesome icons do not render in buttons of outputs since JupyterLab 4.6.0a4\n\n## Reproduce\n\n<img width=\"593\" height=\"181\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/672bff16-b485-44ca-a4c9-81d6b00ccf4b\" />\n\n```python\nfrom IPython.display import HTML\nHTML(\"<button class='fa fa-fw fa-copy minimal jp-Button'></button>\")\n```\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThey do\n\n## Context\n\n- Browser and version: Chrome\n- JupyterLab version: 4.6.0",
